---

<section data-reveal class="editorial-film overflow-hidden bg-white py-16 lg:py-24">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1368px] items-center gap-12 px-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
    <div>
      <p class="text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.1em] text-[#434343] uppercase">
        Editorial &amp; Fine Art Photography
      </p>
      <h2 class="font-display mt-3 text-3xl font-thin text-[#303133] sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl">
        The Wedding Photography + Film Company
      </h2>

      <p class="mt-6 text-base leading-6 text-[#797979]">
        At Cameraboss, we believe every love story deserves to be beautifully
        told. From the quiet glances to the grand celebrations, our team is
        here to document your big day with elegance and heart.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[17.6px] leading-[1.5] text-[#797979]">
        Whether you're searching for a <strong class="font-bold">London wedding
        photographer and videographer</strong>, planning your celebration in
        <strong class="font-bold">Leicester or Manchester</strong>, or looking
        for our talented <strong class="font-bold">team of wedding
        photographers in Nigeria</strong>, Cameraboss is ready to be part of
        your journey.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[17.6px] leading-[1.5] text-[#373737]">
        Start by completing our simple enquiry form — whether you've already
        found a package that suits you or want something more personalised.
        Share your ideas, your vibe, and your budget, and we'll craft a
        bespoke wedding package that truly reflects your style.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[17.6px] leading-[1.5] text-[#373737]">
        Let's bring your vision to life and make magic together.
        <strong class="font-bold text-[#797979]">
          Start planning your unforgettable wedding with Cameraboss today.
        </strong>
      </p>

      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="mt-8 inline-block rounded-full border border-[#434343] px-9 py-4 text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.1em] text-[#434343] uppercase transition-colors hover:bg-[#434343] hover:text-white"
      >
        Enquire Now
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="relative grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <img
        src="/images/company/cinematic-shot.png"
        alt="Cinematic wedding photography moment"
        class="h-72 w-full rounded-sm object-cover sm:h-96"
      />
      <img
        src="/images/company/wedding-heels-ring.png"
        alt="Wedding heels and ring detail"
        class="mt-10 h-72 w-full rounded-sm object-cover sm:h-96"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
